[2026-02-04T17:32:38.376Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FGezWwWnUrdTj9JM1Vt9G7","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"AI automation replacing jobs 2026 survey hiring managers 44% 55% layoffs\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Companies Are Laying Off Workers Because of AI’s Potential—Not Its Performance\",\"url\":\"https://hbr.org/2026/01/companies-are-laying-off-workers-because-of-ais-potential-not-its-performance\"},{\"title\":\"Nearly 4 in 10 companies will replace workers with AI by 2026, survey shows | HR Dive\",\"url\":\"https://www.hrdive.com/news/companies-will-replace-workers-with-ai-by-2026/760729/\"},{\"title\":\"Top 20 Predictions from Experts on AI Job Loss in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://research.aimultiple.com/ai-job-loss/\"},{\"title\":\"AI isn’t the reason you got laid off (or not hired), top staffing agency says | Fortune\",\"url\":\"https://fortune.com/2025/12/09/will-ai-steal-my-job-layoffs-low-hire-fire-economy-manpower-survey/\"},{\"title\":\"The AI layoff trap: Why half will be quietly rehired\",\"url\":\"https://hrexecutive.com/the-ai-layoff-trap-why-half-will-be-quietly-rehired/\"},{\"title\":\"77 AI Job Replacement Statistics 2026 (New Data)\",\"url\":\"https://www.demandsage.com/ai-job-replacement-stats/\"},{\"title\":\"Companies That Have Replaced Workers with AI in 2025 and 2026\",\"url\":\"https://tech.co/news/companies-replace-workers-with-ai\"},{\"title\":\"Are you next? The truth behind AI layoffs in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.thehrdigest.com/are-you-next-the-truth-behind-ai-layoffs-in-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Investors predict AI labor displacement accelerates in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.techbuzz.ai/articles/investors-predict-ai-labor-displacement-accelerates-in-2026\"},{\"title\":\"245,000 Tech Jobs Lost as Companies Shift to Artificial Intelligence | Tech Layoffs 2026: Amazon, Intel, UPS Job Cuts Surge Amid AI Automation | Massive Tech Job Losses in 2025-2026: AI Replacing Human Workforce | Amazon, Intel, Meta Layoffs 2026: Tech Industry Workforce Crisis | AI Automation Triggering Massive Corporate Layoffs Worldwide\",\"url\":\"https://www.sakshipost.com/news/tech/245000-tech-jobs-lost-companies-shift-artificial-intelligence-476986\"}]\n\nI found relevant survey data on AI automation and job replacement in 2026. Here are the key findings:\n\n## Survey Results on AI and Job Replacement\n\nIn a survey of 1,000 U.S. business leaders, 39% have conducted layoffs in 2025, 35% expect to lay off workers before the end of the year, and 58% believe layoffs are likely in 2026.\n\nNearly 3 in 10 companies said they've already replaced jobs with AI, and by the end of 2026, 37% expect to have replaced jobs with AI.\n\n## Employer Regret\n\nOne particularly striking finding comes from Forrester research: According to Forrester, 55% of employers report regretting laying off workers for AI. This suggests that companies are making these decisions based on anticipated AI capabilities rather than proven results.\n\n## Perspectives from Other Surveys\n\nPwC's global CEO survey found that 42% of CEOs believe AI will displace more jobs than it creates, while 39% disagree, reflecting a divided outlook.\n\nHowever, 57% of generative AI decision-makers surveyed by Forrester say they expect AI to increase employment at their organizations, not decrease it.\n\nThe search results show a complex picture where companies are planning significant workforce changes around AI, though opinions vary widely on whether this will ultimately lead to net job losses or creation.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"6edf7236-0a78-480b-bf8a-9077d5a117cc","tool_use_result":{"query":"AI automation replacing jobs 2026 survey hiring managers 44% 55% layoffs","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Q8T3HFb6BA15kME7cF5