[2026-02-04T17:32:55.717Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015ZFWnJ7wGeUCsTBqG4BbQb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Resume.org survey 2026 layoffs 55% hiring managers AI driver 44%\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs\",\"url\":\"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/resumeorg-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026-yet-6-in-10-will-have-layoffs-302654255.html\"},{\"title\":\"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/resume-org-survey-great-turnover-205000780.html\"},{\"title\":\"The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs - Resume.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.resume.org/the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026-yet-6-in-10-will-have-layoffs-2/\"},{\"title\":\"Employers plan to hire ‘aggressively’ in 2026 — but only for certain roles | HR Dive\",\"url\":\"https://www.hrdive.com/news/companies-hiring-and-firing-2026/809286/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 tech company layoffs\",\"url\":\"https://www.informationweek.com/it-staffing-careers/2026-tech-company-layoffs\"},{\"title\":\"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs | | goskagit.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.goskagit.com/resume-org-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026/article_77ce8840-5cab-5180-b509-78c0ef1c6a1d.html\"},{\"title\":\"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs | The AI Journal\",\"url\":\"https://aijourn.com/resume-org-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026-yet-6-in-10-will-have-layoffs/\"},{\"title\":\"6 in 10 Companies Plan To Lay Off Employees in 2026 Amid Economic Uncertainty - Resume.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.resume.org/6-in-10-companies-plan-to-lay-off-employees-in-2026-amid-economic-uncertainty/\"},{\"title\":\"Hiring is on tap for 2026—but so are layoffs | DC Velocity\",\"url\":\"https://www.dcvelocity.com/editorial/featured/hiring-is-on-tap-for-2026-but-so-are-layoffs\"},{\"title\":\"Resume.org Survey: 6 in 10 Companies Plan To Lay Off Employees in 2026 Amid Economic Uncertainty | The AI Journal\",\"url\":\"https://aijourn.com/resume-org-survey-6-in-10-companies-plan-to-lay-off-employees-in-2026-amid-economic-uncertainty/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found comprehensive information about the Resume.org 2026 survey you referenced. Here are the key findings:\n\n## Key Survey Results\n\nMore than half of hiring managers (55%) say their company expects layoffs next year. Companies cite AI (44%), reorganization or restructuring (42%), and budget constraints (39%) as the top drivers of layoffs, suggesting workforce reductions are part of broader realignment and cost-control strategies rather than tied to one single factor.\n\n## Timing of Layoffs\n\nNearly half (48%) say layoffs will definitely or probably occur in Q1, including 17% who say layoffs will definitely occur and 31% who say they probably will.\n\n## The AI Narrative Gap\n\nInterestingly, 59% admit they emphasize AI when explaining hiring freezes or layoffs because it plays better with stakeholders than citing financial constraints. However, only 9% say AI has fully replaced certain roles, while 45% say it has partially reduced the need for new hires and another 45% report little to no impact on staffing levels.\n\n## Hiring Plans\n\nDespite the layoffs, 92% of companies plan to hire in 2026, with 86% hiring in Q1.\n\n## Top Skills Needed\n\nCompanies are prioritizing candidates with problem-solving skills (54%), the ability to learn new tools quickly (44%), and communication skills (43%), indicating employers are focused on adaptability and impact rather than titles or tenure.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"c829fff6-989e-4e89-b809-aabb548cbb1e","tool_use_result":{"query":"Resume.org survey 2026 layoffs 55% hiring managers AI driver 44%","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_012ceGEBKvocmqUZZTcCMWAP","content":[{"title":"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/resumeorg-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026-yet-6-in-10-will-have-layoffs-302654255.html"},{"title":"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/resume-org-survey-great-turnover-205000780.html"},{"title":"The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs - Resume.org","url":"https://www.resume.org/the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026-yet-6-in-10-will-have-layoffs-2/"},{"title":"Employers plan to hire ‘aggressively’ in 2026 — but only for certain roles | HR Dive","url":"https://www.hrdive.com/news/companies-hiring-and-firing-2026/809286/"},{"title":"2026 tech company layoffs","url":"https://www.informationweek.com/it-staffing-careers/2026-tech-company-layoffs"},{"title":"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs | | goskagit.com","url":"https://www.goskagit.com/resume-org-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hire-in-2026/article_77ce8840-5cab-5180-b509-78c0ef1c6a1d.html"},{"title":"Resume.org Survey: The Great Turnover: 9 in 10 Companies Plan To Hire in 2026, Yet 6 in 10 Will Have Layoffs | The AI Journal","url":"https://aijourn.com/resume-org-survey-the-great-turnover-9-in-10-companies-plan-to-hir