[2026-02-04T17:33:07.222Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VCvsUK5s9GDEz3pkeCfqC3","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"tech layoffs 2026 roles affected customer service software engineering middle management\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"9 Trends Shaping Work in 2026 and Beyond\",\"url\":\"https://hbr.org/2026/02/9-trends-shaping-work-in-2026-and-beyond\"},{\"title\":\"2026 tech company layoffs\",\"url\":\"https://www.informationweek.com/it-staffing-careers/2026-tech-company-layoffs\"},{\"title\":\"Layoffs Tracker - All Tech and Startup Layoffs\",\"url\":\"https://www.trueup.io/layoffs\"},{\"title\":\"A comprehensive list of 2025 tech layoffs | TechCrunch\",\"url\":\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/12/22/tech-layoffs-2025-list/\"},{\"title\":\"Tech jobs in 2026: layoffs, AI hype, and new roles - Rest of World\",\"url\":\"https://restofworld.org/2026/tech-jobs-2026-ai-layoffs-hybrid-work/\"},{\"title\":\"Tech Sector Hit by Widespread Layoffs in 2025-2026: AI Reshapes the Workforce\",\"url\":\"https://ekhbary.com/news/tech-sector-hit-by-widespread-layoffs-in-2025-2026-ai-reshapes-the-workforce-660-2.html\"},{\"title\":\"Some big-name companies are laying off workers. Here's what it means - ABC News\",\"url\":\"https://abcnews.go.com/Business/big-companies-laying-off-workers-means/story?id=129630523\"},{\"title\":\"Layoffs.fyi - Tech and Startup Layoff Tracker\",\"url\":\"https://layoffs.fyi/\"},{\"title\":\"Tech Layoffs: US Companies With Job Cuts In 2024 And 2025\",\"url\":\"https://news.crunchbase.com/startups/tech-layoffs/\"},{\"title\":\"A comprehensive list of 2025 tech layoffs\",\"url\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/comprehensive-list-2025-tech-layoffs-134836336.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what's happening with tech layoffs in 2026 regarding the roles you asked about:\n\n## Overall 2026 Layoff Trends\n\nSo far in 2026, there have been 28 layoffs at tech companies with 5,285 people impacted (294 people per day). In 2026, 55% of 1,000 U.S. hiring managers surveyed by Resume.org said they expect layoffs, and 44% anticipate that AI will be a top driver of layoffs.\n\n## Specific Roles Affected\n\n**Customer Service:** Salesforce reduced its workforce by approximately 5,000 employees in 2025, with a significant portion of these cuts affecting customer support teams, with some roles being replaced by AI-powered agents.\n\n**Software Engineering:** Many layoffs from the large tech giants were software engineers. Additionally, reductions affect roles across engineering, recruiting, software development, and product management.\n\n**Middle Management:** ASML plans to lay off 1,700 employees, mainly affecting management roles in the company's IT and tech departments, and the company plans to shift these management positions to more engineering roles in an effort to reduce corporate bureaucracy. Amazon's headcount reduction is part of an effort \"to strengthen our organization by reducing layers, increasing ownership, and removing bureaucracy.\"\n\n## Key Drivers\n\nAI is also expected to be a significant cause of layoffs this year. The focus appears to be on streamlining organizational structures and replacing certain roles with AI-powered solutions.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ecff7720-544d-482b-91e9-9eb1a0db0dee","uuid":"27ce3878-92bd-4436-a851-7ba3dfda0faa","tool_use_result":{"query":"tech layoffs 2026 roles affected customer service software engineering middle management","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Cam2amC74mZ1vq1qYtNx6X","content":[{"title":"9 Trends Shaping Work in 2026 and Beyond","url":"https://hbr.org/2026/02/9-trends-shaping-work-in-2026-and-beyond"},{"title":"2026 tech company layoffs","url":"https://www.informationweek.com/it-staffing-careers/2026-tech-company-layoffs"},{"title":"Layoffs Tracker -